  "body": [
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You channel vital energy to heal the living or damage the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "undead",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/undead"
        },
        {
          "content": ". If the target is a willing living creature, you restore 1d8 Hit Points. If the target is undead, you deal that amount of vitality damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": " ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "cost": "Single Action",
          "kind": "actionGlyph"
        },
        {
          "content": " The spell has a range of touch.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "cost": "Two Actions",
          "kind": "actionGlyph"
        },
        {
          "content": " (",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "concentrate",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/concentrate"
        },
        {
          "content": ") The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing a living creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.\n ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "cost": "Three Actions",
          "kind": "actionGlyph"
        },
        {
          "content": " (",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "concentrate",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "trait/concentrate"
        },
        {
          "content": ") You disperse vital energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the burst.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
